290: 
291: - All Must FRs and AC-001..AC-044 have evidence in TRACK.
292: - Supabase/RLS review gate passed (AC-035).
293: - Type-check, lint, build, integration, E2E, and the regression suite pass; new E2E specs passed 3 consecutive 
runs in Chrome and Edge; Firefox verification recorded.
294: - Phase-end migrations applied online with authorization, readback, and smoke recorded (AC-034).
295: - Owner final test of the new app against the online database with two accounts.
296: - Hand-off states the application is ready to deploy after the migrations; deployment is performed by the owner.
