[SPEC:255](/E:/projects/virtual-office/spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md:255), 
[state.md:144](/E:/projects/virtual-office/spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/state.md:144). **Fix:** add 
